00:01:06.755 --> 00:01:09.620
Now, if you're
implementing these,

18
00:01:09.620 --> 00:01:12.409
these probabilities
are all numbers

19
00:01:12.409 --> 00:01:13.880
less than one, in fact,

20
00:01:13.880 --> 00:01:17.180
often they're much less than
one and multiplying a lot

21
00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:21.135
of numbers less than one
result in a tiny number,

22
00:01:21.135 --> 00:01:24.050
