the beam width?

139
00:07:09.965 --> 00:07:12.970
Share the pros and cons
of setting beam to be

140
00:07:12.970 --> 00:07:15.610
very large versus very small.

141
00:07:15.610 --> 00:07:18.835
If the beam width is very large,

142
00:07:18.835 --> 00:07:22.870
then you consider a lot of
possibilities and so you

143
00:07:22.870 --> 00:07:24.865
